1
00:00:33,015 --> 00:00:35,128
LONDON, 1974

2
00:00:36,259 --> 00:00:39,096
Is anyone still in the house?

3
00:00:39,982 --> 00:00:43,459
Your grandmother, in 1962.

4
00:00:45,688 --> 00:00:48,298
Close it, then.

5
00:00:50,156 --> 00:00:52,601
Read it to me.

6
00:00:55,086 --> 00:00:57,931
There's someone on the road.

7
00:00:58,942 --> 00:01:02,113
I'll fix it on Sunday.

8
00:01:04,144 --> 00:01:07,182
He said he would call after work.

9
00:01:09,405 --> 00:01:13,799
We need to leave before it gets dark.

10
00:01:15,390 --> 00:01:18,794
Did you feed the dog?

11
00:01:35,674 --> 00:01:39,311
Translated by whom? It's full of mistakes.

12
00:01:39,832 --> 00:01:41,926
Not now. Later.

13
00:01:43,021 --> 00:01:45,936
Stop the car!

14
00:01:48,230 --> 00:01:51,179
On the table, next to the lamp.

15
00:01:51,864 --> 00:01:54,886
It's raining again.

16
00:01:55,702 --> 00:01:58,643
Ask Dr.Brandt, not me.

17
00:01:59,113 --> 00:02:01,669
What is it?

18
00:02:03,437 --> 00:02:06,610
The play was directed by my uncle.

19
00:02:07,869 --> 00:02:10,189
Who wrote it?

20
00:02:26,878 --> 00:02:30,026
Where did you put the keys?

21
00:02:40,800 --> 00:02:43,779
Then we take the long road.

22
00:02:46,182 --> 00:02:50,359
"Call now or visit
bestmattress-deals.com!"

23
00:02:50,809 --> 00:02:53,756
Twice. He still looks hungry.

24
00:02:55,547 --> 00:02:58,078
Wait, I forgot my coat.

25
00:03:00,552 --> 00:03:03,910
Pass me the salt, please.

26
00:03:06,259 --> 00:03:10,048
The signal died.Net is down too.

27
00:03:39,486 --> 00:03:42,333
The garage roof leaks.

28
00:03:44,267 --> 00:03:47,295
You always say that.

29
00:03:48,298 --> 00:03:52,095
Is your brother coming tonight?

30
00:03:52,354 --> 00:03:55,115
The soup is too hot.

31
00:03:57,197 --> 00:04:00,102
You said that last month.

32
00:04:00,895 --> 00:04:04,049
I can't sleep with the window open.

33
00:04:04,892 --> 00:04:07,999
Let's go. We're late.

34
00:04:10,200 --> 00:04:14,069
Is anyone still in the house?

35
00:04:41,849 --> 00:04:45,868
Send the photos to ellen.marsh@gmail.com.

